WEBVTT

00:02:27.963 --> 00:02:30.630
at the same moment, at the same time.

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:34.963
I'm thinking about how tough
New York can be,

00:02:34.997 --> 00:02:36.897
how rough and unrelenting.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:41.063
But maybe that intensity
is what fuels our tenacity.

00:02:41.997 --> 00:02:44.530
As we navigate through this crisis,

00:02:44.563 --> 00:02:48.097
I am hopeful we will find some solace

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.297
together.

00:02:59.897 --> 00:03:02.830
A Love Letter to Travel
by Debbie Millman